IOP modules for mmcefs
======================

mmcefs loads these into the IOP on its first mount if they are not already
running.  Install them on the PS2 root filesystem:

  mkdir -p /lib/modules/irx
  cp iomanX.irx fileXio.irx mmceman.irx /lib/modules/irx/

(or point the module parameter irx_dir= at another directory).

  file          source                                         sha256
  iomanX.irx    ps2sdk v2.0.0 + PSBBN IOPRP 2.4.x compat       a49e6bac68f1e7d9602c99238729e83a07b6a5158841abaeb26af1e8ad125268
  fileXio.irx   ps2sdk, ps2dev release v2.0.0 (2026-05-17)     d158651ca5fcf623e12913a27d0ab1b7f94b03c9e700e7bcc223cf898a7e6711
  mmceman.irx   ps2-mmce/mmceman + PSBBN/SIO2/VFS fixes        d60b73eb85910869e9b97061ed4c45094f18c9e96574390707f214b6fedbc247
  poweroff.irx  ps2sdk v2.0.0                                  2de34ce2aa4f2f65d74594c27282ccf036083b49dd8a167849dbba3c7ba1ad5d

